        "created_at": "2014-09-06T13:28:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1. Pretty much, the only one not&nbsp;quite there&nbsp;is 5, Impaling Structures will go away no matter how the card is taken back.</p><p>2. As of right now, the only way to get rid of them is by removing the card from play.</p><p>3. I believe they all do.</p>",
